  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support JWU protection services for women victims of gender-based violence (GBV) in Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assist the Jordan Women Union in the provision of gender-sensitive protection services (including psychological, social, legal and shelter services) that are safely accessible by women and girls that are most vulnerable to violence and in need of protection.</narrative>
